  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is negative or shows recent downward momentum.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to recent price spikes — apply a lagged correction to prevent overshoot.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is significantly above/below 30-day moving average, pull toward it by 10-15%.",
    "Reduce forecast volatility during low-sentiment periods — especially when sentiment is flat or negative.",
    "Increase forecast bias toward higher values when sentiment is positive and recent prices are trending upward.",
    "Correct for overconfidence in early periods — especially when history shows consistent underperformance in first 5-7 days of forecast horizon."
  ]
